36_2008__2007-01_2007-06_2007-07.md"}],"reference_presentation":{"group":"review","label":null},"metadata":{"topics":["stated supply","judicial commission","presbytery authority"],"case_numbers":["2007-7"],"body":"SJC","synopsis":"Lee challenged Korean Eastern Presbytery’s actions affecting his interim pastoral relationship, alleging that its October 3, 2006 meeting lacked a quorum. The SJC held the complaint moot and declared every action taken at that meeting null and void—not merely those concerning his church. The meeting opened with only two ruling elders when three were required, and the minutes did not establish when a quorum was later achieved; its presence therefore could not be presumed."}},{"id":"bco:21-9--rpr_exception:rpr/exc/metro-atlanta__050.html","record_id":"rpr_exception:rpr/exc/metro-atlanta__050.html","type":"RPR exception","title":"Metro Atlanta: No provision made for installation of candidate.","year":2025,"disposition":"satisfactory","authority_weight":"low-but-important","url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/rpr/exc/metro-atlanta__050.html","raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/raymond-rishty/pca-ga/main/rpr/exc/metro-atlanta__050.html","evidence_basis":"structured_provision_tag","relevance_status":"unreviewed","occurrences":[{"id":"bco:21-9--rpr_exception:rpr/exc/metro-atlanta__050.html:occ-61a5579679c8","url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/rpr/exc/metro-atlanta__050.html","repository_path":"rpr/exc/metro-atlanta__050.html","locator":{},"excerpt":"","sources":["index/rpr_search.json:provisions"],"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/raymond-rishty/pca-ga/main/rpr/exc/metro-atlanta__050.html"}],"reference_presentation":{"group":"review","label":null}},{"id":"bco:21-9--rpr_exception:rpr/exc/chicago-metro__074.html","record_id":"rpr_exception:rpr/exc/chicago-metro__074.html","type":"RPR exception","title":"Chicago Metro: For a TE whose call changed from Assistant to Associate, there is no record of appointing "